schema AgentSessionReceiptFidelity
generation control-1
authority native-kernel
absorbs run8-side-lane:2026-08-20#CrowBe/agentbranch#290

record AgentSession
  field session_id identity required
  field agent_profile_ref reference required
  field root_work_node reference required
  field events sequence AgentEvent required

record AgentEvent
  field session_id reference required
  field sequence u64 required monotonic contiguous
  field kind enum model_turn context_compaction strategy_change required
  field evidence_origin enum subject host external required
  field work_node reference required
  field observed_at timestamp required
  field provider_identity reference required_when kind=model_turn
  field model_identity reference required_when kind=model_turn
  field provider_session_ref representation optional
  field context_before_ref reference required_when kind=context_compaction
  field context_after_ref reference required_when kind=context_compaction
  field strategy_before_ref reference required_when kind=strategy_change
  field strategy_after_ref reference required_when kind=strategy_change
  field reason_ref reference required_when kind=context_compaction|strategy_change

record ReceiptEnvelope
  field identity identity required
  field subject reference required
  field occurrence_ref reference required
  field status text required
  field session_id reference required
  field first_event_sequence u64 required
  field last_event_sequence u64 required
  field evidence sequence ReceiptEvidence required

record ReceiptEvidence
  field event_sequence u64 required
  field evidence_ref reference required
  field origin enum subject host external required
  field artifact_identity identity required
  field producer_identity identity required
  field model_identity identity required_when event.kind=model_turn
  field producer_verifier_ref reference required_when event.kind=model_turn
  field transport_identity identity required_when origin=external

invariant stable-session-identity
  statement AgentSession identity does not change when provider, model, carrier, or provider-native session reference changes

invariant provider-fidelity-per-model-turn
  statement every model_turn records provider and model identity and ReceiptEvidence repeats both at the same event sequence and origin with an explicit producer verifier observation

invariant context-management-is-observable
  statement context compaction and strategy changes are distinct events with changed before/after references and an observable reason reference

invariant evidence-origin-fidelity
  statement subject, host, and external evidence origins are typed and cannot satisfy one another during receipt coverage validation

invariant orthogonal-evidence-identities
  statement artifact/content identity, producer/model identity, and transport/session identity remain separately typed receipt dimensions

forbidden_inference provider_session_ref -> AgentSession identity
forbidden_inference host or external evidence -> subject provider fidelity
forbidden_inference artifact identity -> producer, model, transport, authority, or claim support
forbidden_inference repeated provider/model attribution -> verified producer fidelity without producer_verifier_ref
forbidden_inference provider attribution -> authority, effect safety, quality, ownership, or evidence sufficiency

native_header engine/core/include/bf_agent_contract.h
native_source engine/core/src/agent_contract.c
witness engine/core/tests/agent_contract_test.c
